  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "11. Charge Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "11.04",
    "summary": "Used by a unit that declared a charge this phase; it can move up to its Charge roll, following the [Moving rules](vsdata:core-rule/moving) (03). Before moving, choose one or more enemy units within 12\" and within that distance; until the move ends each is a charge target. Every model has to end nearer to at least one charge target. It must also get within 1\" of a target if possible and engage a target if possible. Afterwards the unit has to be [engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) with every charge target and with no other enemy unit, and its models gain [Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first) until the turn ends.",
